    "count": 3,
    "label": "Technical Electives (three courses)",
    "notes": "A course cannot be taken both as part of a focus sequence and as a TE. Courses such as SE 195, SE 197, and SE 198 are not allowed as technical electives; SE 199 can be used as a technical elective only under restrictive conditions (four units, approved petition). TE selections must have departmental approval."
